      *                                                                 03010068
           Move  1                       To    Ws-Idx                   03020068
           Perform Until Ws-Idx > Ws-Max-Occ-Item-Tab                   03030068
                                                                        03040068
               Evaluate True                                            03050068
                                                                        03060068
                 When RTFCE110-I-Selected-I    (Ws-Idx)     = 'U'       03070068
                  And RTFCE110-I-Type-I        (Ws-Idx) Not = 'U'       03080068
                                                                        03090068
                   If  RTFCE110-I-Selected-D (Ws-Idx) = 'Y'             03100068
                       Move  'F'         To    RTFCE110-I-Type-I        03110068
                                                              (Ws-Idx)  03120068
                       Move  'TF-SY-TYPE-MISSING'                       03130068
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    03140068
                       Perform  Z700-Error-AE                           03150068
                   End-If                                               03160068
                                                                        03170068
               End-Evaluate                                             03180068
                                                                        03190068
               Add  1                    To    Ws-Idx                   03200068
                                                                        03210068
           End-Perform                                                  03220068
