      *<META C300-PERMITTED-VALUES>                                     03950068
      *                                                                 03960068
      *    Kontrakt-Nr must be numeric if present.                      03970068
      *                                                                 03980068
           Evaluate True                                                03990068
             When  RTFCE110-I-Contract-No-I                             04000068
                                         Not = 'U'                      04010068
               Continue                                                 04020068
             When  RTFCE110-I-Contract-No-D                             04030068
                                         Not Numeric                    04040068
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFCE110-I-Contract-No-O 04050068
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  04060068
               Move  'Kontrakt-Nr'       To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 04070068
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code    04080068
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                   04090068
           End-Evaluate                                                 04100068
      *                                                                 04110068
      *    Rate-Nr must be numeric if present.                          04120068
      *                                                                 04130068
           Evaluate True                                                04140068
             When  RTFCE110-I-Part-Amount-No-I                          04150068
                                         Not = 'U'                      04160068
               Continue                                                 04170068
             When  RTFCE110-I-Part-Amount-No-D                          04180068
                                         Not Numeric                    04190068
               Move  'F'                 To                             04200068
                                         RTFCE110-I-Part-Amount-No-O    04210068
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  04220068
               Move  'Rate-Nr'           To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 04230068
               Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code    04240068
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                   04250068
           End-Evaluate                                                 04260068
      *                                                                 04270068
      *    Kunde-Id must be numeric if present.                         04280068
      *                                                                 04290068
           Perform                                                      04300068
              Varying  Tally             From 1 By 1                    04310068
              Until    Tally             >     RTFCE110-I-Customer-Id-A 04320068
              Evaluate True                                             04330068
                When  RTFCE110-I-Customer-Id-I(Tally)                   04340068
                                         Not = 'U'                      04350068
                  Continue                                              04360068
                When  RTFCE110-I-Customer-Id-D(Tally)                   04370068
                                         Not Numeric                    04380068
                  Move  'F'              To    RTFCE110-I-Customer-Id-O 04390068
                                               (Tally)                  04400068
                  Move  'FELT1'          To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  04410068
                  Move  'Kunde-Id'       To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 04420068
                  Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&'                             04430068
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    04440068
                  Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                04450068
              End-Evaluate                                              04460068
           End-Perform                                                  04470068
