               Evaluate True                                            05780068
                 When  RTFCE110-I-Custm-Type-I (Ws-Idx)                 05790068
                                         Not = 'U'                      05800068
                   Continue                                             05810068
                 When  RTFCE110-I-Custm-Type-D (Ws-Idx)                 05820068
                                         = spaces                       05830068
                   Continue                                             05840068
                 When  RTFCE110-I-Custm-Type-D (Ws-Idx)                 05850068
                                         = 'T'                          05860068
                   Continue                                             05870068
      *          When  RTFCE110-I-Custm-Type-D (Ws-Idx)                 05880068
      *                                  = 'B'                          05890068
