                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    06230068
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                   06240068
                                                                        06250068
           End-If                                                       06260068
           Add  1                        To    Ws-Idx                   06270068
                                                                        06280068
           End-Perform                                                  06290068
