      * Add Perform statements to other sections that contain the      *09590068
      * actual controls.                                               *09600068
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*09610068
      *<META E000-CONTROL-BASE>                                         09620068
       E000-Control-Base                 Section.                       09630068
      *                                                                 09640068
      *</META>                                                          09650068
      *                                                                 09660068
      *                                                                 09670068
           Perform E100-Check-Status                                    09680068
      *                                                                 09690068
      *    Are the proposed changes allowed?                            09700068
      *                                                                 09710068
      *    Fjernet 06.11.2000 (av ndl) fordi den skapte andre feil.     09720068
      *    If  RTFCE110-I-Operation-Type-D = 'AMEND-COLL-MAIN'          09730068
      *        Perform E200-Check-Part-Amount                           09740068
      *    End-If                                                       09750068
      *                                                                 09760068
           Perform E300-Check-Related-Party                             09770068
           Perform E400-Validate-Change                                 09780068
           Perform E500-Check-Account-No                                09790068
           Perform E600-Check-Geo-Country-Code                          09800068
      *    Perform E700-Check-Bic-Code                                  09810068
      *                                                                 09820068
           .                                                            09830068
      *                                                                 09840068
