           Move  1                       To    Ws-Idx                   16670068
           Perform Until Ws-Idx > Ws-Max-Occ-Item-Tab                   16680068
                                                                        16690068
               If  RTFCE110-I-Type-I (Ws-Idx) = 'U'                     16700068
               And RTFCE110-I-Customer-Id-I   (Ws-Idx)  = 'U'           16710068
                   Perform E410-Read-SYS-Code-Rel                       16720068
                   If  R7919999-Return-Error                            16730068
                       Perform E420-Read-SYS-Code                       16740068
                       Move  'F'         To    RTFCE110-I-Type-O        16750068
                                               (Ws-Idx)                 16760068
                       Move  'VAR1'      To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  16770068
                       If  R115ISC0-Description Not = Spaces            16780068
                           Move  R115ISC0-Description                   16790068
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 16800068
                       Else                                             16810068
                           Move  RTFCE110-I-Type-D (Ws-Idx)             16820068
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 16830068
                       End-If                                           16840068
                       Move  'VAR2'      To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  16850068
                       Move  RTFCE110-I-Operation-Type-D                16860068
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 16870068
